{"id":"z01-11","volume":1,"volumeTitle":"周纪一","volumeSubtitle":"前391","index":11,"title":{"t":"安王十一年","s":"安王十一年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀一 · 前391 · 庚寅","s":"周纪一 · 前391 · 庚寅"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国攻打韩国的宜阳，夺取了六座城邑。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宜","s":"宜","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陽","s":"阳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"六","s":"六","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"邑","s":"邑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"当初，田恒生下襄子盘，盘生下庄子白，白又生下太公和。","tokens":[{"t":"初","s":"初","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"田","s":"田","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"恆","s":"恒","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"生","s":"生","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"襄","s":"襄","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"盤","s":"盘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"盤","s":"盘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"生","s":"生","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"莊","s":"庄","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"白","s":"白","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"白","s":"白","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"生","s":"生","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"和","s":"和","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"就在这一年，田和把齐康公迁到海边，只留给他一座城的收入，用来供奉他祖先的祭祀。","tokens":[{"t":"是","s":"是","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歲","s":"岁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"田","s":"田","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"和","s":"和","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"遷","s":"迁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"康","s":"康","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"海","s":"海","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"上","s":"上","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"使","s":"使","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"食","s":"食","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"一","s":"一","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"城","s":"城","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"奉","s":"奉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"先","s":"先","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"祀","s":"祀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周安王十一年，公元前391年。秦国攻韩的宜阳，拿走六座城。本年更要紧的是齐国内部。司马光用初追溯田氏世系，从田恒到襄子盘、庄子白，再到太公和。太公和就是田和。这一年他把姜姓的齐康公迁到海边，只留一座城维持姜氏的祭祀。","theme":"秦取六邑是边境得失。齐国这一条是政权转移：康公还活着，还保留祭祀，但已经被迁走，只靠一座城过活。田氏本年还没有正式成为诸侯，那是后来的册命。本年先写出迁和食一城，姜齐的名号还在，实权已经不在康公手里。","technique":"第一句仍是伐和取的短编年。后面两句换成追溯。初把笔墨拉回田恒，三代一气写完，再用是岁拉回本年。这是《通鉴》在编年里插入家世的办法。没有对话，田和的动机也不写，只写迁到哪里、留下什么。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"邑","reading":"yì","note":"有城的居民点。六邑是六座城，不是一个名叫六邑的地方。"},{"word":"迁","reading":"qiān","note":"把人迁走。这里是把齐康公迁离国都。"},{"word":"先祀","reading":"xiān sì","note":"祖先的祭祀。留下一座城，是为了让姜氏还能祭祖。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"初","reading":"chū","note":"叙事标记，用来追述田氏的先世，不是空泛的起初。"},{"word":"于","reading":"yú","note":"于海上，就是在海边。"},{"word":"以","reading":"yǐ","note":"用来。食一城的目的是奉先祀。"},{"word":"其","reading":"qí","note":"指齐康公。奉的是他自家祖先的祀。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"邑","note":"城邑，不要理解成现代随便一个行政区的名字。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"食","reading":"shí","note":"动词，靠一座城的租税过活，不是把这座城吃下去。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"使食一城","note":"使的后面省略齐康公。田和只让他享有一座城。"}]}}
